	(text "EoS F280049C Board, rev A, two BoosterPack-compatible (40-pin) sites. Designed by Kartikeydheer Srivastava.\nCopyright (c) 2026 Kartikeydheer Srivastava. All rights reserved; see LICENSE.txt.\nValues from TI SPRS945H (TMS320F28004x) and SPRACZ9A; TI SPRU655I; Silicon Labs CP2102N Rev. 1.5;\nDiodes DS37274; Littelfuse SP05xxBA and 1206L; Nexperia PMEG6010CEH; SiTime SiT8008B; Kingbright; TI SLVA689A.\nFirmware: X1 single-ended (XTALCR.SE = 1); clear GPAAMSEL for GPIO22; LIN-A in SCI mode for site A's UART.\nJP1: none = flash boot, 1-2 = SCI boot (USB bridge), 3-4 = CAN, both = parallel.\nBudget: BoosterPacks 200 mA in all from 3.3 V and 5 V pins, no more than 125 mA from 3.3 V.\nJ1.1 and J5.41 (3.3 V) are outputs only; the 5 V pins carry USB VBUS less a fuse and a Schottky."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
